{"id":29,"date":"2022-11-21T12:25:24","date_gmt":"2022-11-21T12:25:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/?post_type=projects&#038;p=29"},"modified":"2025-06-03T23:51:33","modified_gmt":"2025-06-03T23:51:33","slug":"our-lady-of-the-waywallan-east","status":"publish","type":"projects","link":"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/project\/our-lady-of-the-waywallan-east\/","title":{"rendered":"Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School, Stages 2-4"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate project-info\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div class=\"grid__details\"\">\n\n                \n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Location<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Wallan East, Victoria<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Client name<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School and Melbourne Archdiocese Catholic Schools (MACS)<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Value<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Stage 2: $1.1 MIL<br \/>\nStage 3: $4.6 MIL<br \/>\nStage 4: $3.5 MIL<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Contract type<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Fixed Price Contract<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Completion<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Stage 2: October 2018 &#8211; January 2020<br \/>\nStage 3: May 2020 &#8211; May 2021<br \/>\nStage 4: April 2022 &#8211; May 2023<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Contractor<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.raysett.com.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Raysett Constructions Australia<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Subconsultants<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Structural &amp; Civil Engineer &#8211; <a href=\"http:\/\/www.adamseng.com.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adams Consulting Engineers<\/a><br \/>\nServices Engineer &#8211; <a href=\"http:\/\/www.njmdesign.com.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NJM Design<\/a><br \/>\nLandscape Architect &#8211; Leftfield Design<br \/>\nBuilding Surveyor &#8211; <a href=\"http:\/\/www.duchateauchun.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DuChateau Chun<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Photographer<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.yelp.com\/biz\/christopher-alexander-photography-blackburn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Christopher Alexander Photography<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                \n                \n                \n                                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__text\">\n                <p>Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School is located in the rapidly growing town of Wallan, 45 km north of Melbourne. All schools are important pieces of community infrastructure but this one matters more than most. Before we began assisting the Melbourne Archdiocese to develop the school, Wallan was without its own education facility \u2014 a pain point for an otherwise thriving community.<\/p>\n<p>Commencing at the greenfield site in 2019, we masterplanned and delivered 10 classrooms, a communal library and brought the outdoors in through integrated landscaping. Now, the foundation to grade-6 school is rapidly expanding. The current stage of works will see it become a 22-classroom facility with a dynamic central learning space designed to increase the school\u2019s capacity to cater to diverse learning formats.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Our Lady of the Way Primary School, Wallan East\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/nT0n_rSMsNA?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-columns-image\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div class=\"grid__image\">\n               <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"619\" height=\"821\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9483-1-8.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School bench in the outdoor field\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9483-1-8.jpg 619w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9483-1-8-226x300.jpg 226w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 619px) 100vw, 619px\" \/>                           <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__image\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"620\" height=\"821\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9318-1-8.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School outdoor area\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9318-1-8.jpg 620w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9318-1-8-227x300.jpg 227w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" \/>                        <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate full-width-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"879\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-11.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School wide angle\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-11.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-11-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-11-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9470-1-11-768x511.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px\" \/>    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate block-quote\">\n        <div class=\"max-sm:w-full ml-auto w-1\/2\">\n            <div>\n                <blockquote>\n\n                <p>Adaptability and durability are key to ensuring school infrastructure can functionally grow alongside users. In achieving this, it\u2019s the details that count.<\/p>\n\n                \n                <\/blockquote>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-thirds-image\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div>\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"853\" height=\"569\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9574-1-11.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School watcher&#039;s lounge\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9574-1-11.jpg 853w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9574-1-11-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9574-1-11-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 853px) 100vw, 853px\" \/>            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-columns-text-image\">\n        \n        \n        \n        \n        <div class=\"grid mt-[30px] md:mt-[50px]\">\n\n            <div class=\"grid__text space-y-12\">\n                                <div><p>All classrooms have sliding doors on two sides that when closed form a corner to encourage focused study time, yet when opened they see the hallways shift from thoroughfares to usable breakout spaces. Clean lines, vibrantly coloured finishes and naturally-lit rooms, will create fun and cheerful learning spaces.<\/p>\n<p>Our master plan optimises the footprint with an economically-efficient solution designed to increase the flexibility of the educational offering.<\/p>\n<p>Our Lady of the Way Primary School is a joyful learning environment that has provided the community access to education \u2014 what could matter more?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__image\">\n                 <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"620\" height=\"744\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9660-1-10.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School basketball court\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9660-1-10.jpg 620w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9660-1-10-250x300.jpg 250w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" \/>            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate full-width-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"880\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-11.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School library\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-11.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-11-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-11-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9645-1-11-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px\" \/>    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate project-carousel\">\n\n        <div class=\"swiper swiper-block\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                    \n                                        \n                        <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"962\" height=\"641\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9496-5-2.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Our Lady of the Way Catholic Primary School reading area\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9496-5-2.png 962w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9496-5-2-300x200.png 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/69A9496-5-2-768x512.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 962px) 100vw, 962px\" \/>                        <\/div>\n\n                                        \n                        <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" widt